msgid "支持范围与选型"
msgstr "Support scope and platform selection"

msgid ""
"本页帮助确认一种精确装配是否处于维护范围。完整支持说明仍由 [原支持记录](../delivery/support.md)维护；本页只提供判断入口。 "
"[事实派生矩阵](../delivery/capabilities.md)读取 SoC／Board／route、provider 和软件夹具，不能替代 "
"PCB 或物理验收。不要按“芯片属于 Cortex-M”推导全部外设可用。"
msgstr ""
"This page helps determine whether an exact assembly is maintained. The "
"[original support records](../delivery/support.md) remain authoritative for "
"complete support statements; this page only provides assessment entry "
"points. The [fact-derived matrix](../delivery/capabilities.md) reads "
"SoC/Board/routes, providers and software fixtures; it cannot substitute for "
"PCB or physical acceptance. Do not infer all peripherals are usable because "
"a chip belongs to Cortex-M."

msgid "选型必须分别核对五个事实"
msgstr "Check five facts separately when selecting a platform"

msgid "核对项"
msgstr "Check"

msgid "权威来源"
msgstr "Authoritative source"

msgid "可得到的结论"
msgstr "Permitted conclusion"

msgid "芯片能力"
msgstr "Chip capabilities"

msgid "精确 SoC JSON 与来源"
msgstr "Exact SoC JSON and provenance"

msgid "该芯片有什么资源；unknown 保持 unknown"
msgstr "Resources the chip provides; unknown remains unknown"

msgid "provider 实现"
msgstr "Provider implementation"

msgid "生产代码、resolver 与派生矩阵"
msgstr "Production code, resolver and derived matrix"

msgid "哪个 controller、route、mode 真正可选"
msgstr "Which controller, route and mode can actually be selected"

msgid "板级授权"
msgstr "Board authorization"

msgid "精确 Board facts 与来源"
msgstr "Exact Board facts and provenance"

msgid "哪种 PCB、引脚、电气配置获准；不能猜接线"
msgstr ""
"Which PCB, pins and electrical configurations are authorized; do not guess "
"wiring"

msgid "软件验证"
msgstr "Software verification"

msgid "[精确软件结果](software-verification.md)"
msgstr "[Exact software results](software-verification.md)"

msgid "特定 source/config/tool/artifact 范围实际执行"
msgstr ""
"Actual execution for a specific source/configuration/tool/artifact scope"

msgid "实板验证"
msgstr "Physical-board verification"

msgid "[物理状态](hardware.md)"
msgstr "[Physical status](hardware.md)"

msgid "真实 station 对精确 tuple 的实际测量"
msgstr "Actual measurements for an exact tuple at a real station"

msgid ""
"[平台参考入口](../reference/platforms/index.md)连接各芯片的软件切片； "
"[选择指南](../reference/platforms/support.md)解释 F407、F470、G474、H743、U575 与 CPU-"
"only Runtime 的差异。两个入口都引用原支持记录，不另建能力规则。"
msgstr ""
"The [platform-reference entry](../reference/platforms/index.md) links chip-"
"specific software slices; the [selection "
"guide](../reference/platforms/support.md) explains F407, F470, G474, H743, "
"U575 and CPU-only Runtime differences. Both reference original support "
"records without creating new capability rules."

msgid "判定流程"
msgstr "Assessment sequence"

msgid "固定完整料号、Board 和 PCB 来源；检查尚未知的晶振、电源和接线事实。"
msgstr ""
"Fix the full part number, Board and PCB provenance; check oscillator, power "
"and wiring facts that remain unknown."

msgid "在派生矩阵中找到精确 mode、controller 和 endpoint；未列模式不自动支持。"
msgstr ""
"Find the exact mode, controller and endpoint in the derived matrix; unlisted"
" modes are not automatically supported."

msgid "使用实际 TOML resolver；冲突、unknown 或不支持的配置应当拒绝。"
msgstr ""
"Use the actual TOML resolver; conflicts, unknowns and unsupported "
"configurations must be rejected."

msgid "比对软件结果的源码、配置与产物，不能借用相邻板或相邻模式的执行身份。"
msgstr ""
"Compare software-result source, configuration and artifacts; do not borrow "
"the execution identity of a neighboring Board or mode."

msgid "在声称物理能力前取得真实 station 记录；当前 MCU HIL 均未执行。"
msgstr ""
"Obtain actual station records before claiming physical capabilities; all "
"current MCU HIL remains unexecuted."

msgid ""
"平台启动不启动调度器。任务、缓冲区、栈、owner 服务预算、停止及恢复策略 属于外部工程。连续流模式也不承诺任意中断延迟或消费者速度下无丢失。"
msgstr ""
"Platform startup does not start the scheduler. Tasks, buffers, stacks, "
"owner-service budgets, stop and recovery policies belong to external "
"projects. Continuous-stream modes also do not promise lossless operation for"
" arbitrary interrupt delays or consumer speeds."

msgid ""
"![CPU Runtime、具体 SoC 和物理资格边界](../assets/diagrams/cortex-m-capabilities.svg)"
msgstr ""
"![CPU Runtime, exact SoC and physical-qualification "
"boundaries](../assets/diagrams/cortex-m-capabilities.svg)"

msgid "CPU Runtime、具体 SoC 和物理资格边界"
msgstr "CPU Runtime, exact SoC and physical-qualification boundaries"

msgid "FIG-13 是软件支持层次图；完整图示适用条件见 [图册](../assets/diagrams/README.md)。"
msgstr ""
"FIG-13 shows software-support layers; see the [diagram "
"atlas](../assets/diagrams/README.md) for complete applicability conditions."
